    {
      "id": "a-2022-black-swatch",
      "issue": "Extracted text shows one black swatch as #00000 in the 2022 PDF.",
      "provisional_resolution": "#000000",
      "status": "provisional",
      "requires_signoff": true,
      "related_token_ids": [
        "eig_black"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a-2022-rgb-teal-900",
      "issue": "The 2022 PDF (p.7, folio 06) lists RGB 4, 65, 64 for #024140, but that hex is 2, 65, 64.",
      "source_value": {
        "hex": "#024140",
        "rgb": [
          4,
          65,
          64
        ]
      },
      "provisional_resolution": "Hex is authoritative; rgb is derived from it, and sync_tokens.py fails on a mismatch.",
      "status": "provisional",
      "requires_signoff": false,
      "related_token_ids": [
        "eig_teal_900"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a-2022-rgb-green-700",
      "issue": "The 2022 PDF (p.7, folio 06) lists RGB 26, 101, 77 for #19644d, but that hex is 25, 100, 77.",
      "source_value": {
        "hex": "#19644D",
        "rgb": [
          26,
          101,
          77
        ]
      },
      "provisional_resolution": "Hex is authoritative; rgb is derived from it, and sync_tokens.py fails on a mismatch.",
      "status": "provisional",
      "requires_signoff": false,
      "related_token_ids": [
        "eig_green_700"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a-2022-print-values-black-white",
      "issue": "The 2022 PDF (p.7, folio 06) gives no RGB, CMYK, or PMS values for the black and white swatches; PMS numbers are printed without a C or U suffix.",
      "provisional_resolution": "cmyk and pms are null for eig_black and eig_white; PMS values are kept exactly as printed.",
      "status": "provisional",
      "requires_signoff": false,
      "related_token_ids": [
        "eig_black",
        "eig_white"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a-neutrals",
      "issue": "The 2022 PDF lists no neutrals besides black and white, but the themes need grid, rule, axis, and caption grays. eig-brand-guidelines.md named a Warm Gray (#A89F94) and a near-black (#1A1A1A) that appear in neither source guide; the rewritten doc drops both.",
      "provisional_resolution": "Tokenize the four grays the themes already use under colors.neutrals, status provisional; do not adopt Warm Gray or #1A1A1A. tables.body.rule_color_hex is kept for existing readers and must equal the hex of rule_color_token.",
      "status": "provisional",
      "requires_signoff": true,
      "related_token_ids": [
        "eig_neutral_grid",
        "eig_neutral_rule_light",
        "eig_neutral_axis",
        "eig_neutral_caption"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a-series-order",
      "issue": "The default series order puts eig_teal_900 next to eig_blue_800 (luminance contrast about 1.4:1), and eig_gold_600, which the previous figure doc used as the second-series and highlight color, has about 2.1:1 contrast on white, below the 3:1 WCAG floor for graphical objects.",
      "provisional_resolution": "Keep the order. test_style.py reports adjacent-contrast and color-vision-deficiency warnings for it on every run; a reorder proposal is queued for the owner.",
      "status": "provisional",
      "requires_signoff": true,
      "related_token_ids": [
        "eig_teal_900",
        "eig_blue_800",
        "eig_gold_600"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a-type-sizes",
      "issue": "The 2022 guide gives no type sizes. The role sizes come from this template (labeled px before token version 2.0.0, but the themes always applied them as points). The 2020 guide specifies smaller sizes.",
      "source_value": {
        "guide": "2020 EIG Design Style Guide.docx",
        "chart_title_pt": 9,
        "chart_title_web_pt": 11,
        "labels_legends_axes_pt": 8,
        "citation_pt": 7,
        "table_text_pt": 8,
        "table_title_bar_pt": 11
      },
      "provisional_resolution": "Keep the template's point sizes (size_pt, the default a theme applies, within size_pt_range) with source template; the 2020 values are the owner's alternative.",
      "status": "provisional",
      "requires_signoff": true,
      "related_token_ids": [
        "chart_title",
        "subtitle",
        "axis_legend_table_body",
        "notes_caption"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "a-legacy-families-scope",
      "issue": "The 2020 guide specified Galaxie Polaris for charts and tables and Tiempos Text for report body text. For figures and tables the 2022 families supersede them; whether they still govern other EIG materials is not settled.",
      "provisional_resolution": "Keep both as legacy_families with their 2020 scope. Themes never select them; docs describing them are rewritten in place rather than deleted.",
      "status": "provisional",
      "requires_signoff": true,
      "related_token_ids": []
    }
  ],
